   "description": "Whether the <b>Actual</b> figure beside this means anything. <b>Tracked</b>: the source is in use, so a zero means nothing was spent. <b>Not Tracked</b>: the source holds no rows anywhere on this site, so a zero means nobody records this. <b>No Source</b>: nothing could ever be spent against this category directly, which is correct for Contingency and Fee — money leaves those by reallocation. Committed is reported separately and can be real even when Actual is not."
